# Flight-recorder store (#29). It moved from the project root into .claude/ so
# it survives container replacement — `.claude/` is host-backed under the
# cut-over, the project root is not.
#
# This needs its OWN rule: `.claude/` is not universally ignored (cc-workflow
# tracks .claude/plans), so without this line recorder output — including
# whatever a timeline captured from a live session — becomes stageable.
.claude/wtf/

# Legacy location, still read during the deprecation window (#29).
.wtf/
